---
layout: base.njk
description: Free calendar of upcoming county tax lien and tax deed sales, with deposits, registration deadlines and a link to every county source.
---
<section class="hero">
  <h1>Every county tax sale, one free calendar</h1>
  <p class="lede">Upcoming tax lien and tax deed sales with dates, deposits, registration deadlines and how to bid, each linked to the county page it came from.</p>
  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat"><b>{{ states.length }}</b> states</div>
    <div class="stat"><b>{{ counties.length }}</b> counties</div>
    <div class="stat"><b>{{ sales.length }}</b> upcoming dated sales</div>
  </div>
  {% include "notice.njk" %}
</section>

<h2>Coming up next</h2>
{% set rows = sales | head(12) %}{% set showState = true %}
{% include "sales-table.njk" %}
<p><a href="/calendar/">See the full calendar →</a></p>

<aside class="callout">
  <p><strong>Want this in your inbox every week?</strong> Alerts send every sale in the next 30 days, what changed since last week, and county parcel lists where reuse is allowed. ${{ site.paid.price }} a {{ site.paid.interval }}.</p>
  <p><a href="/alerts/">See what Alerts include →</a></p>
</aside>

<h2>Browse by state</h2>
<div class="grid">
{% for st in states %}
  <a class="card" href="{{ st.url }}">
    <h3>{{ st.name }}</h3>
    <p>{{ st.sale_type | capitalize }} state · {{ st.counties.length }} counties · {{ st.upcomingCount }} dated sales</p>
  </a>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<h2>New to tax sales?</h2>
<div class="grid">
{% for g in collections.guide | guidesSorted | head(4) %}
  <a class="card" href="{{ g.url }}"><h3>{{ g.data.title }}</h3><p>{{ g.data.description }}</p></a>
{% endfor %}
</div>
<p><a href="/guides/">All guides →</a></p>

{% include "signup.njk" %}
